{"unit_id": "tag:00AN:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>可知，该函子（functor）是全忠实（fully faithful）的。由引理<REF_0002>可知，它是本质满射（essentially surjective）的（通过一个显式给出的拟逆（quasi-inverse）函子（functor））。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实"}, {"source_term": "essentially surjective", "target_term": "本质满射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-inverse", "target_term": "拟逆"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "被证明具有所述两个性质的函子。"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实", "context": "第一个引理给出的函子性质。"}, {"source_term": "essentially surjective", "target_term": "本质满射", "context": "第二个引理给出的函子性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-inverse", "target_term": "拟逆", "context": "修饰用于证明本质满射性的函子。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "在证明本质满射性时显式给出的拟逆函子。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:00AK:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这个引理的意思是，若层（sheaf）<MATH_0001>由粘合（glueing）数据<MATH_0002>构造而成，且<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>上的层（sheaf），则态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>由一族态射（morphisms）<MATH_0006>给出，它们都在层（sheaves）之间，且与粘合（glueing）映射（maps）<MATH_0007>相容。类似地，给出态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>（其源和目标均为层（sheaves）），等同于给出一族态射（morphisms）<MATH_0009>，它们都在层（sheaves）之间，且与粘合（glueing）映射（maps）<MATH_0010>相容。\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "由粘合数据构造的对象。"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "修饰构造该层所用的数据。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "条件中给定在所述空间上的对象。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一句中由一族态射给出的单个态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第一句中给出单个态射的一族态射。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "第一族态射的源和目标。"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "修饰第一族态射须与之相容的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "第一族态射须与之相容的粘合映射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二句中与给出一族态射等价的单个态射。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "第二句中单个态射的源和目标。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "第二句中与单个态射对应的一族态射。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "第二族态射的源和目标。"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "修饰第二族态射须与之相容的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "第二族态射须与之相容的粘合映射。"}], "notes": []}
